        "v": 5,
        "title": "Remove noisy websocket logging in deadConnectionCleaner",
        "summary": "Removed `logger.info` and `logger.error` calls in `backend/src/websockets/server.ts` within the `deadConnectionCleaner` function. This eliminates redundant log entries for inactive connection terminations and individual connection check errors, reducing noise in the backend logs. The change is internal, affecting only the websocket server's logging behavior.",
        "significance": "minor",
