      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The system stopped writing routine log messages about inactive connections being closed and minor connection check errors. If you look at the backend logs today, you will see fewer entries from idle connection cleanup, making the remaining log lines easier to read. This is a behind-the-scenes maintenance change affecting only internal logging behavior.",
